  "details": "- CVE-2026-19666: clear the aliased noqname pointer in query_addanswer() on the\n  DNS64 filter64 path before the rdataset is returned to the message pool\n- CVE-2026-19667: reject negative cache records that do not fit in a dns_rdata_t,\n  and report a repeated singleton or a second SOA RRset as DNS_R_TOOMANYRECORDS\n- CVE-2026-80274: record the accepted denial type with the rdataset so that\n  dns_rdataset_addnoqname() and dns_rdataset_getnoqname() select the same\n  NSEC/NSEC3 and RRSIG pair",
